# RBAC Permission Matrix
# Generated by Ansible — do not edit manually
# Phase 10.15: RBAC Permission Matrix

## Role Hierarchy

```
platform-admin
├── All project-admin permissions
├── Create/manage projects
├── Manage all project members
├── Full platform admin access
├── View all projects
├── Read/write all projects
├── Delete projects
├── System configuration
└── Audit log access

project-admin
├── All project-member permissions
├── Manage own project members (add/remove/roles)
├── Read/write own projects
├── Delete own projects
├── Manage project settings
└── View project audit logs

project-member
├── Read own projects
├── Read project issues
├── Read project docs
└── View project activity
```

